  extracted from partials/janaka_visual_resume_v3_3.html
- Rebuild index.html + all section partials on that system; drop
  Tailwind CDN, Vanta, AOS and Feather (no external JS dependencies)
- Add EN/DE language switch (data-i18n + assets/js/i18n.js); language
  and theme persist via the same localStorage keys as the visual CV
- Language-aware PDF link (EN CV / DE Lebenslauf)
- Align experience timeline, metrics and language levels with the
  visual CV as source of truth; keep all narrative content
- Preserve all features: chat popup (now lazy-loaded, Esc to close),
  work-history collapsible, journey tabs, Academy CTA, footer links
- Fix broken absolute photo path, stray markup, and footer year script
  that never executed when injected via innerHTML
- Accessibility: aria labels/states, focus management in modal,
  reduced-motion and print styles; semantic heading order
- Document repo structure and conventions in README

